@format 1
@id edit.change-tone
@title Change brightness or contrast
@area Edit
@entry input
@summary Apply a brightness or contrast control change to the preview, refresh the processing indicators, and request persistence of the active source plan.
@flow TB
@related edit.save-plan, edit.restore-plan

@alias inspector = Cadroue.UIShell.PPanels.PInspector
@alias tab = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainArea.PEditTab

[input] Tone control changes <input>
- Interpret a brightness or contrast checkbox, slider, or number-field change and raise the inspector event @ inspector.PInspectorVideoAttach(...)
> update

[update] Apply tone state <process>
- Refresh Crop and tone active-step indicators @ tab.PEditActiveUpdate(...)
- Convert active brightness and contrast values into preview color state @ tab.PEditColorApply(...)
- Request persistence for the active source @ tab.PEditChangeHandle(...)
> persist

[persist] Continue to plan persistence <output>
> map:edit.save-plan
